A tab is content in a heading key and in a cross-reference id

```
# A	B

see [A B][]
.
<section id="A-B">
  <h1>A	B</h1>
  <p>see [A B][]</p>
</section>
```

```
# A	B

see [A	B][]
.
<section id="A-B">
  <h1>A	B</h1>
  <p>see <a href="#A-B">A	B</a></p>
</section>
```

```
# A  B

see [ A B ][]
.
<section id="A-B">
  <h1>A  B</h1>
  <p>see <a href="#A-B"> A B </a></p>
</section>
```

```
a </#no	pe> b
.
<p>a &lt;/#no	pe&gt; b</p>
```
